---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import BlurLSA from '../assets/InstallACunit.jpeg';
import RankingExample from '../assets/greeminisplit.jpg';
---



<!-- SECTION 1: Local SEO -->
<section class="bg-[#D6E6FA] text-black flex items-center justify-center py-12 px-6">
  <div class="max-w-6xl w-full grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
    <!-- Image -->
    <div class="relative flex flex-col items-center animate-slide-in-left order-2 md:order-1">
      <img 
        src={RankingExample.src} 
        alt="AC technicians working" 
        class="w-full h-auto object-cover rounded-lg shadow-lg border-2 border-white/20 animate-pulse-glow"
      />
    </div>

    <!-- Text -->
    <div class="flex flex-col text-white space-y-6 animate-slide-in-right order-1 md:order-2">
      <div class="order-1">
       
      </div>

      <div class="order-2 space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold leading-tight text-black">
          Air Conditioning Installation & Air Conditioner Repair in Port Richey, FL
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg opacity-90 text-black">
          Looking for ductless AC installation near Port Richey or New Port Richey? Farrell Air Conditioning is your trusted GREE mini split installer, serving homeowners and small businesses across Port Richey with reliable, high-efficiency cooling solutions. GREE systems are perfect for homes without ductwork, garages, additions, or any space where traditional HVAC systems fall short.

 <br><br>We provide energy-efficient, whisper-quiet ductless air conditioners that are built to handle Florida’s heat and humidity. As certified GREE professionals, we take the time to properly size your system, install it with precision, and offer ongoing service to keep it running at peak performance. Whether you're upgrading your home’s comfort or adding targeted cooling to a new space, Farrell Air Conditioning delivers expert mini split installation backed by years of local experience.
           
        </p>
       
      </div>
      
    </div>
    
  </div>
  
</section>
<a href="tel:7273277355" class="text-white justify-center align-center text-3xl text-md md:text-md font-semibold w-full sm:w-full md:w-1/4 lg:w-1/5 mt-10 lg:text-3xl flex items-center pr-1 pl-1 gap-x-1 mx-auto mb-10  bg-[#007dfc] hover:bg-[#007efcd3] hover:cursor-pointer h-16 rounded-lg">Call Now: 727-327-7355</a>
<!-- SECTION 2: Paid Visibility -->
<section class="relative bg-[#08439d] pt-20 flex items-center justify-center py-12 px-6 pb-40">
  <div class="max-w-6xl w-full grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 z-10">
    <!-- Text -->
    <div class="flex flex-col text-white space-y-6 animate-slide-in-left order-1 md:order-1">
      <div class="order-1">
      
      </div>

      <div class="order-2 space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold leading-tight">
         Port Richey, FL: HVAC Installation & AC Repair
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg opacity-90">
          At Farrell Air Conditioning, we don’t just check boxes, we fix problems the right way. Our certified technicians are trained to catch what others miss and fine-tune your HVAC system so it runs like it should: clean, quiet, and efficient.
<br></br>
We offer more than routine inspections, we deliver performance-focused service that keeps your system reliable year-round. Whether it's a nagging issue or a full system install, we give straight answers, solid solutions, and real warranties that back up our work.
<br></br>
If you’re in Port Richey and tired of band-aid repairs or half-baked service, call Farrell Air Conditioning. We show up, we know what we’re doing, and we stand behind every job.
         
        </p>
       
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Image -->
    <div class="relative flex flex-col items-center animate-slide-in-right order-2 md:order-2">
      <img 
        src={BlurLSA.src} 
        alt="Gree minisplit" 
        class="w-full h-auto object-cover rounded-lg shadow-lg border-2 border-white/20 animate-pulse-glow"
      />
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Bottom Wave SVG -->

  
</section>
